+4. the ranks all-gather fixed-size arrays of KV-block counts across the Decode
+   DP group, padding unused request slots with zeros
 5. the planner generates a per-rank plan that can pause local running requests,
    admit selected local waiting requests, or freeze new admission
 6. only selected waiting requests are considered for asynchronous remote KV
